# Production build values, committed deliberately. See the note in the repo
# root .gitignore for why.
#
# ONLY public service URLs belong here. Every VITE_* value is substituted into
# the client bundle at build time and is therefore visible to anyone who opens
# the deployed JavaScript. Never put a secret in this file.
#
# A real environment variable set in the build environment overrides anything
# here, so Cloudflare's build variables stay authoritative where they work.
# This file is the floor that stops a missing dashboard variable from shipping
# a bundle with an empty URL in it -- which fails silently, because Roktim
# renders nothing when it has no address to call.

VITE_ROKTIM_URL=https://roktonet-forecast.onrender.com
